  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release contains 44 commits since the first commit: 2 breaking changes, 3 bug fixes.\n\nBREAKING CHANGES:\n- rename package to SoftThorn.MyAnimelistNET\n- rename package to SoftThorn.MAL.ApiClient - Reference the SoftThorn.MAL.ApiClient package and namespace instead of SoftThorn.MyAnimelistNET. Rename AddMyAnimelist to AddMalApiClient, MyAnimelistService to MalApiService, and MyAnimelistLoginHandler to MalLoginHandler.\n\nHighlights:\n- The package is now SoftThorn.MAL.ApiClient, identifies itself with a User-Agent, and retries rate-limited requests with backoff.\n- Fixed a crash in long-running apps after the HTTP handler lifetime of two minutes ran out.\n- Updating anime and manga list status works now, and requests that MyAnimeList leaves unanswered are retried after 20 seconds.\n\nBug fixes:\n- repair deserialization found by snapshot tests\n- register message handlers as transient\n- repair list status updates, retry hung requests\n\nDependencies:\n- update Cake build packages and tools, fix build pipeline\n\nDocumentation:\n- add package update plan for NuGet and tools\n- leave commits to the repo owner\n- document namespaces and update repo layout\n\nOther changes:\n- Initial commit\n- project setup\n- add default nswag c# templates\n- fix return type generation\n- use template directory\n- added cake frosting pipeline\n- added basic oauth workflow and integration test\n- setup fully automated updating of c# client via openapi spec\n- use .NET 10\n- update dependencies\n- update nuget packages\n- fix build\n- update client\n- dont update assemblyinfo during debugging to allow hotreload to work\n- make login in tests work, with manual approval\n- make login in tests work with playwright\n- Expand README with usage, API overview and build docs\n- Add CLAUDE.md with notes for Claude Code sessions\n- Harden OAuth flow, rename facade, drop leftovers\n- Add TokenClient with refresh grant and split test projects\n- Update packages and drop unused declarations\n- Record decision to upgrade Verify to 33.x\n- Upgrade Verify to 33 and xUnit to 4\n- Update README.md\n\nAll changes: https://github.com/Insire/SoftThorn.MAL.ApiClient/commits/v0.0.37",
